  "behavior": [
    "Public AudioClip decode, share, metadata and PCM sequence call their exact native symbols.",
    "A creator-independent clip or retained sample sequence is usable on a language worker. A closed clip view refuses queries, while independently retained samples remain readable.",
    "Checked cancellation, callback exceptions and a bounded decode are verified without an audio device.",
    "The private real CPU mixer verifies source-frame trimming, exact last frame, silence after playback and rate conversion. Sound and sequence allocation prefixes are balanced with the audio engine still alive.",
    "PCM traversal uses one admitted read scope and reads native float slots. The tested warm traversal permits zero new XRT allocations. Decode and cold sequence acquisition allocate their owners, and admission uses an existing runtime lock."
